Datadog Security Playground EU1 companion guide

This repository provides community installation helpers and policy examples
for the upstream DataDog/datadog-security-playground project:
https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-security-playground

Upstream source revision used by the demo:
32b896ac15c9414678b3d6bfa6ddbd3cbc31f16f

The upstream playground is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Its application image and simulator binaries are obtained separately from the
upstream project; this repository does not redistribute those binaries.

This companion guide and its recording are not an official Datadog release.
